                "description": "Complete solution conversion graph with positive arrowed axes, 10-unit grid and numeric labels 10–100 on both axes. Ordinary axes and labels use black; the conversion series uses house blue.",
                "mathematics": "EUR = 0.6 AUD; the line passes through (0,0) and (100,60), continuing slightly beyond the latter with an arrow.",
                "answerVisibility": "Solution only; the supplied line and graph are not student givens."
              },
              "derived": false,
              "reviewStatus": "needs-review"
            }
